              "content": "=You are an expert HR recruitment assistant.\n\nAnalyze the hiring requirements provided below and create a professional, clear, and optimized Job Description.\n\nHiring Requirements:\n{{ $json.snippet }}\n\nCreate the Job Description with these sections:\n\n1. Job Title\n2. Job Summary\n3. Key Responsibilities\n4. Required Technical Skills\n5. Required Qualifications\n6. Required Experience\n7. Preferred Skills\n8. Soft Skills\n9. Location and Work Mode\n\nUse professional and inclusive language. Make the description concise and attractive to suitable candidates.\n\nImportant:\n- Use only the information provided in the hiring requirements.\n- Do not invent skills, qualifications, experience, salary, or benefits.\n- Remove unnecessary repetition.\n- Clearly separate required and preferred requirements.\n- Return only the final Job Description.\n- Output should be a HTML file arranging the entire JD in a professional Look"
